<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mad people came up this tower with a\nRainbow Wing tryna summon HO-OH.\rNone of ’em got HO-OH to show up...\rThe Rainbow Wing just a hall pass.\nThat’s it. It ain’t a magic feather.\rWhat HO-OH want is real TRUST between\npeople and homies...\rNot clout. HO-OH can smell clout.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time ago, there was a\nhomie at the top of this tower:\fHO-OH.\rBut it flew off, and nobody\nseen it since...\rIf somebody who could bring back\nreal trust between people and\fhomies came through with\fsomethin’ tied to HO-OH... It might\fcome down for ’em...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That thing you got...!\nYou serious?! Where you get that?!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You did it...\nC’mon through.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That Rainbow Wing just a hall pass.\rIf you ain’t the kinda person who\nbring trust back between people and\fhomies, HO-OH ain’t showin’ up.\fNo matter how many times you clap.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm.\rSo it was you and the Bell!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a real one for your age...\nI was stealin’ hubcaps at your age.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: Bell Tower is where people and\nhomies test their trust.\rYou might be born with it...\fWe should swap numbers.\rI wanna see the trust you got with\nyour homies. And I’m lonely. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Morty’s number\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: Hit me up on Tuesday nights.\nI should be free.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: I DEADASS wanted to see your\ntrust with your homies...\fI’ll just go stare at a wall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0057_D17R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: You wanna swap\nnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
